<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss Jan car registrations fall prov 6.5 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Swiss Jan car registrations fall prov 6.5 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Registrations of new cars in Switzerland and Liechtenstein fell a provisional 6.5 percent in January to 19,479 from 20,834 a year earlier, the Swiss Automobile Importers Association (VSAI) said.</p>
<p>Definitive figures for December showed registrations rose to 16,312 from 15,346 in December 1995.</p>
<p>For the full year 1996, registrations were off 1.2 percent at 269,529 from 272,897, according to the definitive numbers.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
